WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.835
Hammerspoon 2 beta

00:00:02.048 --> 00:00:03.510
the macOS automation

00:00:03.322 --> 00:00:04.642
tool is rewritten

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.333
Version 2 is

00:00:06.145 --> 00:00:06.911
now the main

00:00:06.723 --> 00:00:07.359
version

00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:08.149
keeps its own

00:00:07.961 --> 00:00:08.904
config so you

00:00:08.716 --> 00:00:09.387
can run it

00:00:09.199 --> 00:00:10.366
beside Hammerspoon

00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:10.684
1

00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:12.312
updates itself and

00:00:12.135 --> 00:00:13.397
ships Getting Started

00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:15.307
Migration and TypeScript

00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:15.791
guides

00:00:16.318 --> 00:00:18.134
Hammerspoon 2 requires

00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:19.596
macOS 27 or

00:00:19.408 --> 00:00:19.985
later

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.913
Hammerspoon 2 is

00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:22.585
a separate app

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.623
from Hammerspoon 1

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:24.201
with its own

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:24.991
configuration

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:25.722
so you can

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:26.689
keep Hammerspoon 1

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:27.491
installed while you

00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:28.104
try it out

00:00:28.638 --> 00:00:29.652
Full story on

00:00:29.463 --> 00:00:30.359
the dashboard
